- op: discuss  # 27e1
  at: '2026-04-19T04:30:28Z'  # 27e1
  by: agent  # 27e1
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 27e1
  clock: 3  # 27e1
  nonce: '27e1'  # 27e1
  message: "Phase 1 fixed in PR #3177 (commit 917161736). New linker hypergumbo_core.linkers.rust_trait_dispatch consumes existing 'implements' edges (WI-tulid) and emits dispatches_to edges from each Rust trait symbol to every concrete method on the implementing struct. Phase 2 (static-dispatch parsing of generic bounds and dynamic-dispatch call-site resolution) deferred — requires call-site type info not currently exposed; SCIP-level data (WI-duzul territory) would provide it. 23 new tests. Acceptance criterion (rust_trait_impl + rust_instruction_descriptor drop from ~3004) needs a dead-code-prospector re-run to measure."  # 27e1
